  Thy humble servant,   Gridley, Squire to Melantheus


From: Tao-Li
To: Uga-Buga Makumb

  Honored Sovereign, 

  With the coming of the spring season I set out to quench my thirst for 
adventure.  I moved into the Cannibal Sea (#1101) with my redoubtable Fleet. 
To the north, the landscape is marred by a broad expanse of ice.

  A fleet coming from the empire of Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll 
invaded the Cannibal Sea, hoping to conquer that province ruled by the 
provincial Merman chieftain and made up of great Seas.  I was in command of 
the attacking fleet.  The defending forces were led by the provincial Merman 
chieftain.  The armies were drawn up into lines of battle as shown here:

  ATTACKING ARMY, Battle of the Cannibal Sea (1101):

   78th   
  Bowmen  
 }}}01}}} 
          
   77th   
  Fleet   
 01 
          
 147th/A  
