  I led my armies into the fray.  No generals were present to lead the 
forces of Giovanna.
  The Skeletal Armies led by Uga-Buga Makumb marched into battle with a 
fanatical fervor.  Kari's fortunes took a terrible turn for the worse when 
some of my troops rebelled against my strict discipline and refused to enter 
battle.  As the struggle developed, the tactical wit of the acting commander 
and I seemed to be evenly matched.

  Across the whole front, the 55th Garrison were arrayed against the 54th 
Garrison, who sang out their battle hymns, infused with a spirit of holy, 
fanatical elan by their exalted King.  The 55th Garrison battled with the 
54th Garrison and were mowed down like sheep.
  The acting commander's great horde overwhelmed the army of Uga-Buga Makumb 
and took the field, scattering their enemies.  The 54th Garrison annihilated 
the 55th Garrison.
  The host of the attacking Kingdom was defeated and driven out of Cascadia. 
My forces completely destroyed, I fled frightened and alone to Marigold.

  Thy humble servant,   Kari


